{"folioDeck": 1, "exportedAt": "2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z", "meta": {"id": "srabc", "title": "Serbian Alphabet", "subtitle": "30 letters, their Latin twins and the accent marks · both directions, as two cards per letter", "desc": "The 30 letters of the Serbian Cyrillic alphabet in their own order, each with its twin in the Latin alphabet, then the five accent marks the level decks print and the r that is a vowel — the first deck of the Serbian collection. Serbian is written in both alphabets, letter for letter, and every level deck prints its headwords in Cyrillic with the Latin beneath. Both directions: see a letter and recall its sound, or see a sound and recall the letter, each a card with its own schedule. Every note gives the letter in capital and small, its Latin equivalent (three Cyrillic letters, љ њ џ, are two Latin ones, lj nj dž), its sound described in English words, and one everyday word that shows it, with a speaker. The letters have no names: a Serbian says a consonant as itself when spelling. The spelling follows Vuk Karadžić's rule of 'write as you speak and read as it is written', so a word is read letter by letter. The sounds are approximations, as every learner's alphabet gives them, and the cards for ђ and џ, ћ and ч say how each pair differs. The accent marks are not part of everyday spelling; dictionaries print them, and so do the level decks, because Serbian stress can fall on any syllable, though rarely the last, and carries a falling or a rising tone on a short or a long vowel: four accents, and a fifth mark for a long vowel after the stress. Sources: Wikipedia, \"Serbian Cyrillic alphabet\" (revision 1380570209) and \"Serbo-Croatian phonology\" (revision 1384903020), CC BY-SA 4.0; the example words and their accents are English Wiktionary's, via the kaikki.org extraction (CC BY-SA 4.0).", "author": "", "language": "en", "color": "#1C4C0E", "tags": ["serbian", "alphabet", "cyrillic"], "glossMode": "site", "types": {"sr-abc": {"id": "sr-abc", "name": "Serbian letter", "speechLang": "sr-RS", "fields": ["Letter", "Latin", "Sound", "Example", "Word"], "cards": [{"name": "Letter → sound", "front": "<div class=\"uc-letter\">{{Letter}}</div>", "back": "{{FrontSide}}<hr><div class=\"uc-field\"><div class=\"uc-pos\">in Latin</div><div class=\"uc-gl\">{{Latin}}</div><div class=\"uc-pos uc-gap\">sound</div><div class=\"uc-gl\">{{Sound}}</div><div class=\"uc-pos uc-gap\">as in</div><div class=\"uc-gl\">{{Example}}<span class=\"uc-tts uc-say\" data-say=\"{{Word}}\"></span></div></div>"}, {"name": "Sound → letter", "front": "<div class=\"uc-ask\">Which letter is this?</div><div class=\"uc-field\"><div class=\"uc-gl\">{{Sound}}</div></div>", "back": "{{FrontSide}}<hr><div class=\"uc-letter\">{{Letter}}</div><div class=\"uc-field\"><div class=\"uc-pos\">in Latin</div><div class=\"uc-gl\">{{Latin}}</div><div class=\"uc-pos uc-gap\">sound</div><div class=\"uc-gl\">{{Sound}}</div><div class=\"uc-pos uc-gap\">as in</div><div class=\"uc-gl\">{{Example}}<span class=\"uc-tts uc-say\" data-say=\"{{Word}}\"></span></div></div>"}], "css": ".card {\n  text-align: center;\n  font-size: 17px;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n}\n.uc-ask {\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n  font-size: 11px;\n  letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  opacity: 0.55;\n}\n.uc-letter {\n  font-size: 64px;\n  font-weight: 400;\n  line-height: 1.15;\n}\n.uc-say {\n  margin-left: 14px;\n  vertical-align: middle;\n  font-size: 15px;\n}\n.uc-field {\n  display: block;\n  width: fit-content;\n  min-width: min(300px, 100%);\n  max-width: 100%;\n  margin: 14px auto 0;\n  padding: 11px 15px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--rule, rgba(0,0,0,0.12));\n  border-radius: 11px;\n  text-align: left;\n  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--paper-2, #EFEDE6) 58%, var(--card, #FFFFFF));\n}\n.uc-pos {\n  margin-bottom: 3px;\n  font-size: 9.5px;\n  letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--ink-faint, #6C6A63);\n}\n.uc-gap {\n  margin-top: 10px;\n}\n.uc-gl {\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\n.uc-ex {\n  font-size: 19px;\n}\n.uc-exe {\n  margin-left: 6px;\n  opacity: 0.62;\n}\n"}}, "version": 1, "createdAt": "2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z", "updatedAt": "2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z", "forkedFrom": null}, "cards": [{"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "А а", "Latin": "A a", "Sound": "&quot;a&quot; as in father", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">ма̏ма</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">mama · mum</span>", "Word": "мама"}, "id": "u_srabc_1", "type": "sr-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "Б б", "Latin": "B b", "Sound": "&quot;b&quot; as in bed", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">бра̏т</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">brat · brother</span>", "Word": "брат"}, "id": "u_srabc_2", "type": "sr-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "В в", "Latin": "V v", "Sound": "&quot;v&quot; as in van", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">во̀да</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">voda · water</span>", "Word": "вода"}, "id": "u_srabc_3", "type": "sr-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "Г г", "Latin": "G g", "Sound": "&quot;g&quot; as in go — always hard", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">гла́ва</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">glava · head</span>", "Word": "глава"}, "id": "u_srabc_4", "type": "sr-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "Д д", "Latin": "D d", "Sound": "&quot;d&quot; as in dog, the tongue against the teeth", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">да̑н</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">dan · day</span>", "Word": "дан"}, "id": "u_srabc_5", "type": "sr-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "Ђ ђ", "Latin": "Đ đ", "Sound": "a soft &quot;j&quot;: the j of jeep said with the tongue flat against the palate; softer than џ", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">ђа̑к</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">đak · pupil</span>", "Word": "ђак"}, "id": "u_srabc_6", "type": "sr-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "Е е", "Latin": "E e", "Sound": "&quot;e&quot; as in met", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">сѐстра</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">sestra · sister</span>", "Word": "сестра"}, "id": "u_srabc_7", "type": "sr-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "Ж ж", "Latin": "Ž ž", "Sound": "&quot;zh&quot;, like the s in pleasure", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">жѐна</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">žena · woman</span>", "Word": "жена"}, "id": "u_srabc_8", "type": "sr-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "З з", "Latin": "Z z", "Sound": "&quot;z&quot; as in zoo", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">зи́ма</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">zima · winter</span>", "Word": "зима"}, "id": "u_srabc_9", "type": "sr-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "И и", "Latin": "I i", "Sound": "&quot;ee&quot; as in meet, but short", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">ри̏ба</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">riba · fish</span>", "Word": "риба"}, "id": "u_srabc_10", "type": "sr-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "Ј ј", "Latin": "J j", "Sound": "&quot;y&quot; as in yes", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">ја̏бука</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">jabuka · apple</span>", "Word": "јабука"}, "id": "u_srabc_11", "type": "sr-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "К к", "Latin": "K k", "Sound": "&quot;k&quot; as in kite", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">ку̏ћа</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">kuća · house</span>", "Word": "кућа"}, "id": "u_srabc_12", "type": "sr-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "Л л", "Latin": "L l", "Sound": "&quot;l&quot; as in ball", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">ле̏то</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">leto · summer</span>", "Word": "лето"}, "id": "u_srabc_13", "type": "sr-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "Љ љ", "Latin": "Lj lj", "Sound": "&quot;ly&quot;, one sound, like the lli of million; written lj in Latin", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">при̏јатељ</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">prijatelj · friend</span>", "Word": "пријатељ"}, "id": "u_srabc_14", "type": "sr-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "М м", "Latin": "M m", "Sound": "&quot;m&quot; as in man", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">мле́ко</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">mleko · milk</span>", "Word": "млеко"}, "id": "u_srabc_15", "type": "sr-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "Н н", "Latin": "N n", "Sound": "&quot;n&quot; as in no", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">но̑ћ</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">noć · night</span>", "Word": "ноћ"}, "id": "u_srabc_16", "type": "sr-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "Њ њ", "Latin": "Nj nj", "Sound": "&quot;ny&quot;, one sound, like the ny of canyon; written nj in Latin", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">ку̏хиња</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">kuhinja · kitchen</span>", "Word": "кухиња"}, "id": "u_srabc_17", "type": "sr-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "О о", "Latin": "O o", "Sound": "&quot;o&quot; as in more, but short", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">о̀тац</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">otac · father</span>", "Word": "отац"}, "id": "u_srabc_18", "type": "sr-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "П п", "Latin": "P p", "Sound": "&quot;p&quot; as in pen", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">пи̑во</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">pivo · beer</span>", "Word": "пиво"}, "id": "u_srabc_19", "type": "sr-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "Р р", "Latin": "R r", "Sound": "a rolled &quot;r&quot;, made with the tip of the tongue; between consonants it is a vowel of its own", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">ре́ка</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">reka · river</span>", "Word": "река"}, "id": "u_srabc_20", "type": "sr-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "С с", "Latin": "S s", "Sound": "&quot;s&quot; as in sun", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">си̑н</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">sin · son</span>", "Word": "син"}, "id": "u_srabc_21", "type": "sr-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "Т т", "Latin": "T t", "Sound": "&quot;t&quot; as in top, the tongue against the teeth", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">та̏та</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">tata · dad</span>", "Word": "тата"}, "id": "u_srabc_22", "type": "sr-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "Ћ ћ", "Latin": "Ć ć", "Sound": "a soft &quot;ch&quot;: the ch of cheap said with the tongue flat against the palate; softer than ч", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">ћа̑о</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">ćao · hi, bye</span>", "Word": "ћао"}, "id": "u_srabc_23", "type": "sr-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "У у", "Latin": "U u", "Sound": "&quot;oo&quot; as in boot, but short", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">у̏лица</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">ulica · street</span>", "Word": "улица"}, "id": "u_srabc_24", "type": "sr-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "Ф ф", "Latin": "F f", "Sound": "&quot;f&quot; as in fun", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">телѐфо̄н</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">telefon · telephone</span>", "Word": "телефон"}, "id": "u_srabc_25", "type": "sr-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "Х х", "Latin": "H h", "Sound": "&quot;kh&quot;, like the ch in Scottish loch", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">хле̏б</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">hleb · bread</span>", "Word": "хлеб"}, "id": "u_srabc_26", "type": "sr-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "Ц ц", "Latin": "C c", "Sound": "&quot;ts&quot; as in cats", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">цве̑т</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">cvet · flower</span>", "Word": "цвет"}, "id": "u_srabc_27", "type": "sr-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "Ч ч", "Latin": "Č č", "Sound": "&quot;ch&quot; as in church, the tongue curled back; harder than ћ", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">ча̏ј</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">čaj · tea</span>", "Word": "чај"}, "id": "u_srabc_28", "type": "sr-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "Џ џ", "Latin": "Dž dž", "Sound": "&quot;j&quot; as in jam, the tongue curled back; harder than ђ; written dž in Latin", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">џе̏п</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">džep · pocket</span>", "Word": "џеп"}, "id": "u_srabc_29", "type": "sr-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "Ш ш", "Latin": "Š š", "Sound": "&quot;sh&quot; as in shop", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">шко̑ла</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">škola · school</span>", "Word": "школа"}, "id": "u_srabc_30", "type": "sr-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "а̏", "Latin": "double grave", "Sound": "the accent mark ȁ: a SHORT stressed vowel with a FALLING tone", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">ку̏ћа</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">kuća · house</span>", "Word": "кућа"}, "id": "u_srabc_31", "type": "sr-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "а̑", "Latin": "inverted breve", "Sound": "the accent mark ȃ: a LONG stressed vowel with a FALLING tone", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">пи̑во</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">pivo · beer</span>", "Word": "пиво"}, "id": "u_srabc_32", "type": "sr-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "а̀", "Latin": "grave", "Sound": "the accent mark à: a SHORT stressed vowel with a RISING tone", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">во̀да</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">voda · water</span>", "Word": "вода"}, "id": "u_srabc_33", "type": "sr-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "а́", "Latin": "acute", "Sound": "the accent mark á: a LONG stressed vowel with a RISING tone", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">мле́ко</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">mleko · milk</span>", "Word": "млеко"}, "id": "u_srabc_34", "type": "sr-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "а̄", "Latin": "macron", "Sound": "the mark ā: a LONG vowel after the stressed syllable, which only a dictionary marks", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">дѐво̄јка</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">devojka · girl</span>", "Word": "девојка"}, "id": "u_srabc_35", "type": "sr-abc"}, {"sub": "", "fields": {"Letter": "р", "Latin": "syllabic r", "Sound": "r as a vowel: between two consonants it carries the syllable, and can carry the accent", "Example": "<span class=\"uc-ex\">ср̏це</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">srce · heart</span>", "Word": "срце"}, "id": "u_srabc_36", "type": "sr-abc"}], "gloss": {}}